        {
          "text": "Annex 5.2 setting out the standard terms and conditions for pre-qualification of single-use injection devices, which all manufacturers must follow. Clauses cover dossier screening, non-refundable fees, ongoing reporting of changes and adverse events, and grounds for suspension or withdrawal. Definitions of packaging terms such as unit container close the annex.",
